ney</h2>As your team travels through dark dying lands, they will have to search for food, solve moral dilemmas and meet mysterious characters. Everything your heroes do affects their mental state, their growth as characters and fighters. <br><br><br><strong>Hunger</strong> is just one problem they have to deal with - as they have to make tough choices, their mental state and moral compass can be damaged or even broken. But as a guide with a purpose, you can use even this to your advantage, building a team of dark and corrupted half-humans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804620/extras/ae7d92ca69ce05d34a9ccc9509654047.poster.avif?t=1667997263\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804620/extras/ae7d92ca69ce05d34a9ccc9509654047.webm?t=1667997263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804620/extras/ae7d92ca69ce05d34a9ccc9509654047.mp4?t=1667997263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Many mysterious inhabitants of the world can share stories or present... <strong>unique</strong> opportunities to your team. <br><br><strong>Misery </strong>and <strong>failure</strong> awaits everyone who dares to walk the<strong> Grim Road</strong>. But also an eventual triumph and many new, different paths to take.","developers":["Muki Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804620/header.jpg?t=1667997263","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1804620/469283/9e512195caad27e40a4627169093188a2f02470a/175103275